# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Art assets — code only in this repo; bring your own art.
#
# content/tiles/ATTRIBUTION.md is explicit that the sample pack shipped with no
# license file and must not be committed until its terms are confirmed. Keeping
# art out is a licensing requirement, not a preference.
#
# Everything below is either that art or regenerable from it:
#   tiles/        source art (the seed's input)
#   *.png         atlases and per-tile sprites pulled/vendored into tilesets/
#   *.tsj         tileset definitions written by sync_tilesets / vendor
#   catalog.json  asset records written by the vendor step
#   *.lock.json   hashes of whatever art was vendored
#
# Hand-authored .tsx tileset definitions ARE tracked: they are metadata, not
# pixels, and they are what a new pack needs in order to import at all.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
content/tiles/
content/tilesets/*.png
content/tilesets/*.tsj
content/tilesets/*.lock.json
content/assets/catalog.json

# Local object store for the Asset Manager (bytes live in Postgres' sibling volume).
tools/asset-manager/storage/
